window.products.push({"id":372160,"name":"PARIJAT HANDICRAFT Copper Moscow Mule Shots Mug Copper Handle Capacity 4 Ounce Solid Copper Classic Moscow Mule Shot Mugs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJertuRRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Moscow Mule is a classic cocktail usually served in a copper mug that has been refreshing tastebuds since the 1940's. Add some flair to your home bar with OUR set of Solid Copper Moscow Mule Mugs. With each one's capacity, these are ideal mugs for the classic mix of vodka, ginger beer, and lime juice. Naturally, enjoying our Mugs simply with beer or other cocktails is also encouraged. Due to their solid copper construction, your beverages will remain cool for an extended duration. For the purists, each mug is Solid Copper, leaving nothing between you and your copper vessel. Our Solid Copper Moscow Mule Mug is not intended for dish washer use. Doing so will cause product discoloration. Hand wash with warm soapy water, and dry thoroughly with a dry cloth. For a fresh take on the Moscow Mule, try this delicious Apple Cider Mule recipe 1 1/2 ounces of vodka 2 ounces of apple cider Juice of 1 lime wedge 2 ounces of chilled ginger beer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJertuRRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARIJAT HANDICRAFT","source_asin":"B077LBFFK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077LBFFK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077LBFFK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":372161,"name":"EASELAND Lift Chairs Recliners for Elderly,Genuine Leather Power Lift Recliner with Heat and Massage Up to 320 LBS，OKIN Motor Living Room Chair with C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":659.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rhD3AQ58L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Power Lift Assistance】:Lift chair is powered by electric and German Brand Okin motor that can control back and footrest simultaneously.When you want to get up from your chair，counter-balanced lift mechanism pushes the entire chair up to assist the user stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees,smoothly adjust to lift or reclining position you prefer by pressing two buttons on the remote control. 【Massage & Vibration】: Power lift recliner comes with 8 vibration nodes on back, lumbar, thigh and leg; 5 vibration modes (pulse, press, wave, auto and normal) with 3 intensities from low to high. One heating system on lumbar area;temperature controlled heating, the temperature is 113℉~140℉, when it reaches 140℉, it will automatically cut off the power, and continue to cool to 113℉ before heating. 【Genuine Leather Material】The Power Lift Chair is made of high quality cowhide leather, which is comfortable to touch and breathable, giving you a comfortable experience. The classic colour is suitable for all styles. In addition, it is very resistant to dirt and easy to clean, leaving you with no burden after use. 【Infinitely Adjustable Angle】The chair backrest can recline from 110° to 160° and the chair footrest can be raised from 90° to 180°. The extending footrest and reclining function allow you to fully stretch and relax while reading, watching videos and sleeping. 【Professional Heavy Duty Design】:This power lift recliner is made from sturdy solid wood and a high weight-bearing alloy stand, strong enough to hold 320 lbs. Practical pockets make it easy to store things and the double side cup holders can store tea or drinks. The USB port keeps your device charged when you're using your phone or Ipad, so you don't need to worry about running out of power to interfere with your device. 【Easy to Assemble]】The chairs come in 2 boxes, we ship on the same day, but the carrier may deliver on a different day. If you have any problems, you can contact us promptly and we will respond within 24 hours. No tools required:Set up in about 10 minutes, just snap the 2 armrests and 1 backrest into the base separately. 【Warranty Policy】 Quality problems caused by non-human causes: 30 days free return, 180 days free exchange and 3-years warranty guarantee. How to contact us? STEPS: Login your amazon account> choose \"Your orders\"> find the order ID> click\" Contact seller\".EASELAND provide helpful, prompt and friendly customer service at your disposal","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rhD3AQ58L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EASELAND","source_asin":"B0BRSCY14Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSCY14Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSCY14Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
