window.products.push({"id":372255,"name":"BeeGreen 12 Pack Reusable Grocery Bags Cute Reusable Shopping Bags Bulk with Buckle Foldable Large 50LBS Heavy Duty Kitchen Eco Bag Machine Wash Chris","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H4DD9SlGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Foldable Design & Hidden Buckle: Shopping bags for groceries can be easily folded, unique hidden buckle can make it better stored, so you can put the foldable bags in your pocket, purse or car, which is very convenient for storaging groceries. This shopping bag is perfect for shopping, groceries, travel, storage and practical for daily use. Xlarge Capacity & Durable: Our reusable tote bags can hold up to 50+ pounds of groceries, like canned food, water, milk, snacks and other stuffs, it can replace 2-3 conventional grocery bags. Reusable bags bulk reinforced with bias tape, lightweight and durable, which makes them hold heavy loads safely. Good Quality & Longer Handles: Large reusable shopping bags are made of 100% nylon cloth with fine stitching, which is ideal fabric for grocery shopping totes. It is Lightweight but very sturdy, resistant to tear. Long handles of the cloth bags allow for hand keeping or carry on the shoulder for more comfortable carrying. You can use them when you travel, shop or store at home. Reusable & Machine Washable: By using these kitchen reusable grocery bags instead of plastic bags, you can save your money and reduce environmental pollution. Our nylon bags can be machine washable, this can free your hands and save your time, very conveinent to your life. Cute Pattern Design: Every set of grocery tote bags are all include 12 reusable bags. These cute bags will add some fun to everyday life and when you go shopping for groceries, you can choose different market bags for different items. Also, cute patterns make our reusable tote bag be perfect holiday gifts like Thanksgiving, Christmas Day, Mother's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H4DD9SlGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0B58WP4QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B58WP4QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B58WP4QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
