window.products.push({"id":372312,"name":"Lighted Palm Tree 5FT 208 LED Artificial Palm Tree Decor with Lighted Coconuts for Outdoor Light up Fake Tree with USB & Adapter for Indoor Outside Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SZuFuSd2L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Unique Design: 3 LED Lighted Coconuts and vivide palm leaves dotted with 208 LED fairy lights, bring you a different tropical style. The lights are soft and not dazzling to give you a special romantic atmosphere at night. Portable Design: USB and transformer two power supply modes, a power bank is enough. Easy disassembly, two steps to install. Packed only 3 feet long and weighing 3.3 pounds, just put it in your trunk and bring it to camping. Safe Design: IP44 waterproof, 4.5V low vlotage, UL certified. This palm tree is safe and cool to touch, suitable for all occasions indoors and outdoors. Perfect for you room, pool, patio, yard and bar. The Best Gift for Family and Friends: simple packaging and convenient installation (no tools required) make this light tree a exquisite and impressive gift for birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, holiday parties, etc. Quality Assurance: All of our LED tree lights come with a 180-day warranty. And We have the best customer service and quality control team to cover your back. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will solve your issues within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SZuFuSd2L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPIRIT STAR CHRISTMAS CENTER","source_asin":"B0C4SZVQZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4SZVQZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4SZVQZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":372313,"name":"Classic Brands Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support, Queen, Linen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UFliX8MLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transpose your master suite from simple to sophisticated by adding the DeCoro Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support . The solid-hued wingback plush headboard brandishes deep inset tufted-buttons with diamond stitching upholstery and fabric that is soft to the touch. The Brighton is constructed from plywood and hardwood and the sturdy and durable wood slat and center support system can be used for any mattress size or type; no box-spring is needed. The low-profile bed frame is supported by 8-inch solid wood legs and the headboard stands at almost 4 1/2-feet and makes a magnificent centerpiece for your bedroom. Available in both grey and linen. Combine our DeCoro Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support with your memory foam, latex, or innerspring mattress to add unparalleled support. It will extend the longevity of your mattress by properly supporting your mattress, and ultimately preventing it from sagging. The slats are specifically designed to be spaced evenly across the top of the platform to form a solid base for your mattress, insuring even weight distribution throughout. The sturdy center support system is a must have for today’s heavier mattresses and is not typically found in other platform beds and is what really differentiates our bed frame from others. Benefits of the DeCoro Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed DeCoro Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed is a decorative way to give your mattress some extra support. The headboard, foundation, and frame are an all in one solution and is an excellent choice as a fashionable alternative to a traditional box spring and frame. You’ll love the way this headboard makes a beautiful statement in your bedroom. Features of the DeCoro Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed With classic styling, the DeCoro Brighton Upholstered Platform Bed transforms any bedroom from drab to glamourousl. Not only is the platform bed well-built and durable, it’s beautiful inset soft button-tufted diamond stitching wing back headboard offers exceptional style and taste. The headboard reaches a height of a little over 4 ½ feet high which instantly makes it a beautiful backdrop and the focus in any bedroom. The upholstered fabric is soft to the touch and the platform bed is available in either grey or linen and is now available in full, queen, or king sizes. Easy Assembly The DeCoro Upholstered Headboard Platform Bed is easy to assemble; it can be put together in less than an hour. All parts, tools, and instructions are neatly packed in a zippered compartment in the back of the headboard. Just unpack, assemble the frame and attach the hardware and you are ready to place your mattress (and foundation if you please) on top. It is recommended that the upholstered bed frame should be assembled in the room that it is intended for use: •Step 1- Take all components out of the box and position them on the floor •Step 2- Attach the legs to the bottom of the headboard and to the bottom of the footboard •Step 3- Assemble the left side rails to the center horizontal support rail. Assemble the right-side rails to the center horizontal support rail.  •Step 4- Attach the headboard to the assembled side rails •Step 5- Attach the footboard to the assembled side rails •Step 6- Attach the center support rails to the middle of assembled bed •Step 7- Attach the horizontal center support rail to the middle of the assembled bed •Step 8- Attach the wood slats •Step 7- Place your mattress on top and enjoy! Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to check the size and the height of your mattress to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of the frame, foundation (if you are adding one), and the mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your bed will be. Also note, because of the solid construction of this platform bed, it is recommended that two people lift and assemble the bed. Total weight should not exceed 700 lbs. including the mattress. • Full Size - 61\" W x 83\" L x 54\" H x 81 lbs • Queen Size - 67\" W x 87\" L x 54\" H x 89 lbs • King Size - 83\" W x 87\" L x 54\" H x 105 lbs Quality Assurance DeCoro Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support is backed with a 3-year worry-free warranty. DeCoro carries a wide variety of upholstered platform bed frames in an assortment of designs to match your unique taste and style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UFliX8MLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B077ST7BMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077ST7BMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077ST7BMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
