window.products.push({"id":372365,"name":"Hillsdale Furniture Janis Metal Sleigh Bed Set with Rails, Queen, Textured Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":395.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ymArB6PAL._AC_.jpg","description":"A smartly scaled janis metal sleigh bed featuring strap spindles that wrap around the top rail. the side legs have a gentle bend to accent the sleigh design theme. set includes one headboard, one footboard, completely welded grills with 1-3/4-inch legs, 1-1/4-inch round rails, cast foot and 1-1/8-inch flat strap spindles. available in textured black color and queen size. headboard measures 62-inch width by 45-inch height and footboard measures 62-inch width by 28-inch height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ymArB6PAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hillsdale","source_asin":"B07FBDFDG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FBDFDG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FBDFDG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
