window.products.push({"id":372466,"name":"Heavenera Set of 2 18\"X18\" Chevron Boho Throw Pillow Beige and Brown Woven Farmhouse Square Pillow Cases Zigzag Cushion Cover for Bed, Couch, Nursery,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ZEPAmhrYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to our store Heavenera® where everything is awesome! Material :- Natural Cotton Size :- 18 x 18 inches (Please allow minor variation in sizes and colors as the throw pillows are handstitched and hand dyed) What you get? - 2 pcs of Woven Throw Pillow Cover Features :- - 100% Natural material which is completely biodegradable and nature friendly. - The throw pillow covers have textured pattern on front and cotton canvas in back side. Durable metal zippers have been used. - Matches wide variety of room decor - bohemian, boho, minimalist, morroccan. Makes a great boho decoration for your couch, sofa, living room or bedroom. It is aesthetic pillow case that will enhance your existing room decor. - Makes a perfect gift for Housewarming parties, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Birthday parties - Easy to Care - These decorative throw pillow covers are machine washable. Machine wash in cold water seperately. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. 100% Cotton products can shrink or get creases during washing. Ironing can straighten the creases and get them to perfect shape. We strive for making high quality products as your home is as unique as you which deserves the very best. Customer Satisfaction is our first priority. If you face any issue, please send us a message and we will try our best to get any issue resolved.Hope to see you soon again in our store! Follow us and stay tuned for more products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ZEPAmhrYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heavenera","source_asin":"B0B3JMBZYK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3JMBZYK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3JMBZYK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
