window.products.push({"id":372504,"name":"Home Coffee Bean Roaster Machine for Beginner Electric Nut Peanut Cashew Chestnuts Roasting Machine 750g Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rLkZ3hhtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ LARGE CAPACITY - Equipped with 750g green coffee bean roasting pan, this can roast a large number of coffee beans and work quickly and easily. Appearance height is 6.5 inches, outer diameter is 12 inches, bottom diameter is 8.85 inches, rated voltage is 110V, heating power is 1200W, fully automatic 0-240℃ adjustable. ☕ NON-STICK & HEAT RESISTANT- The black food-grade base material of this coffee bean roaster is safe and easy to clean. The non-stick pan not only makes the coffee roast healthy but also retains the fresh taste of the coffee. Heat resistant plastic body, with safe handle design. ☕ HIGH EFFICIENCY - The coffee roaster can roast 750 grams of green coffee beans in 25 minutes featuring110V high-power agitator, and the larger roasting chamber can roast with large capacity 1200w heating power. Please note the optimal amount of roasted coffee beans is 300g-500g. ☕ PROFESSIONAL DESGION - The coffee roaster builds with a rotating rod inside, which can stir evenly and roast the coffee beans at a constant temperature. The transparent lid with 4 ventilation holes allows you to see the roasting color, smell the aroma, and evaluate the coffee roasting process. 100-240°C adjustable temperature allows you to find the baking level accurately. ☕ MULTIFUNCTIONAL - The automatic coffee roaster is perfect for beginners at home. Easy to use, strong maneuverability, just select the required temperature for different roasting requirements, the thermostatically controlled roasting element can ensure that the roasted coffee beans are uniform and reach the required roasting level. The affordable home coffee roasters can also be used to roast a variety of beans such as peanuts, popcorn, raw melon seeds, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rLkZ3hhtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEONEBEBE","source_asin":"B08GQ71VRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GQ71VRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GQ71VRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
