window.products.push({"id":372516,"name":"ZiYan 40 Inch Giant 22th Black Number Balloons,Birthday/Party balloons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+6-Sr9B7L._AC_SL1401_.jpg","description":"Foil supershape number '22' balloons these are fantastic for 22st birthdays, You will get two digital balloons 2. The balloon can be filled with helium to float or filled with air to attach to any surface, it has a self sealing valve. The balloon will come flat and need inflating. Once inflated the balloon will stay up for over a week. Feature: ★Easy to inflate using the a straw or an air handheld pump ★Easily hung on strings from ceilings or attached to wall with tape ★Reusable. Self-sealing valve for easy inflation and deflation. ★Shipped uninflated. Can be air filled or helium filled ★ WARNING: CHOKING HAZARD - Children under 8 yrs. Can choke or suffocate on uninflated or broken balloons. Adult supervision required. Keep uninflated balloons from children. Discard broken balloons at once.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+6-Sr9B7L._AC_SL1401_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIYAN","source_asin":"B07DB6HSV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DB6HSV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DB6HSV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
