window.products.push({"id":372568,"name":"Fab Glass and Mirror 16\" x 24\" Rectangle 3/8\" Thick Tempered Glass Table Top Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iUAGDpYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Glass Table Top ✔ 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐨𝐟 𝐓𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐨𝐩 - A glass table top is a piece of furniture with a flat surface made out of glass. Glass tabletops are popular for their aesthetic appeal and ability to blend with any decor. These clear tempered glass tabletops are more durable than normal glass and are heat-resistant and less likely to break or shatter. ✔ 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐓𝐨𝐩 𝐓𝐡𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 - The glass table top also adds a unique, modern touch to any room. Many glass tabletops are available in a variety of shapes and styles, allowing you to customize the look of your furniture. It's a sturdy tabletop replacement glass with a thickness of 3/8\" inch (10mm) Pencil edges that adds elegance to both the interior and exterior of a table. ✔ 𝐔𝐬𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐟 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐨𝐩 - If you're looking for a stylish and modern way to add character to your home, rectangular table top glass has different sizes which can perfectly fit on your glass table top. It can be used as coffee tables, end tables, dining tables - even as wall art! so they make great choices for homes with children or pets. ✔ 𝐅𝐮𝐧𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐨𝐟 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐨𝐩 - Glass table top is a great choice for any room. They are aesthetically pleasing and can be used to create a modern look. Glass table tops are also great for small spaces since they don’t take up much visual space. They can be used as coffee tables, end tables, dining tables, and more. ✔ 𝐀𝐟𝐭𝐞𝐫-𝐒𝐚𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐀𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 - After-sales support is fast and reliable – with our easy return process. Our delivery damage rate is extremely low, at less than 0.5%. If something arrives damaged, we offer fast replacements or refunds free of charge. We strive to respond as quickly as possible to all inquiries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iUAGDpYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fab Glass and Mirror","source_asin":"B0751FL2XT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0751FL2XT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0751FL2XT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":372569,"name":"InfuseZen Plush Turkish Cotton Bath Towel, 1 Piece Reversible Mandala Design, Heavyweight Large Towel Bath Sheet, 64” Long x 36” Wide (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91up-KNifKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The InfuseZen plush double sided mandala towel is the perfect balance of luxury and function. Thick and comfortable, absorbent and quick drying, you will instantly fall in love with the weight and softness of this Turkish bath towel. This listing is for one large bath towel. If you are sick and tired of all those bath sheets that lose their softness and absorbency after every wash, then this is your lucky day. Introducing the InfuseZen premium 100% Turkish cotton towel with stylish flower mandala print on both sides. Not only will this towel dry you off completely and dry quickly, it will also elevate the look of your bathroom as well! Now you can finally have a gym, yoga or bath towel that is not only thick and plush, but also stylish and extremely absorbent! Because the Turkish cotton is quick drying, odors do not accumulate like they do on standard terry bath towels. Our towels also make great gifts and are a good way to impress company in a guest bathroom. Top 3 Reasons To Choose Our Full Terry Towel: 100% Turkish Cotton Fabric: unlike other cheaply-made bath towels, our luxury double sided towel is made from 100% premium Turkish cotton, which has longer fibers and will become softer after every wash. Loomed in Turkey. One Towel, Unlimited Uses: you can use your Turkish towel as a gym towel, bath towel, pool towel, spa towel, camping towel, picnic blanket or beach blanket. Use it as a sarong or wrap, a partial couch cover or as a small lap blanket. It also makes a great throw cover for a lounge or patio chair. Stylish Mandala Geometric Pattern Design: Now you don’t have to sacrifice style in your bath towels, this on-trend flower mandala print design is woven right into the towel with inverse colors on the backside. The quality of this towel is top notch and now your bath sheets can be both fashionable and functional!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91up-KNifKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InfuseZen","source_asin":"B09KDGRQC1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KDGRQC1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KDGRQC1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
