window.products.push({"id":372771,"name":"GEDLIRE Produce Saver Containers for Refrigerator 3 Pack, Stackable Plastic Fridge Food Fruit Vegetables Storage Bins with Vented Lids, Clear Freezer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XBb7DwebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌽【Keep Fruits and Vegetables Fresh】: Our fridge food storage containers with the lids which have vent system.It can regulates the flow of air in and out, control the humidity inside of vegetable keeper, help prevent spoilage, keep fruits and vegetables storage longer in the refrigerator. 🌽【Classified Storage Design】: The large containers measures 12.4” x 6.4” x 5.7”, capacity 5700 ml, storing for lettuce, cabbage, broccoli, tomatoes, carrots, cucumbers, corn, asparagus, beets, cauliflower, onions and other veggies. The 2 small one measures 5.6” x 5.6” x 4.6”, capacity 1700 ml for grapes, cherries, strawberries, lemons, blueberries, raspberries, blackberries and other small fruits. 🌽【Stackable & Filter Tray Design】: The filter tray at the bottom to elevates produce away from moisture and can directly storage after cleaning, to filter out the water on the surface of vegetables and fruits and reduces spoilage. And due to the stackable layout, our produce storage container can maximize the usage of your kitchen fridge and pantry organization. 🌽【Food Grade BPA-Free Materials】: These clear storage bins are made of durable and BPA free shatter-resistant PET plastic, Make sure your food is safe to store inside. Easy to clean without absorbing stains or smells. Perfect for refrigerator, picnic party, work lunches, travel and more. 🌽【Notice and After-Sales Service】: Do not place this food containers in dishwasher. Please clean with hands using mild detergent and water (temperature range -20 degree to 50 degree). If you are not satisfied with our products or received cracked products, please feel free to contact us. We will provide the refund or replacement to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XBb7DwebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEDLIRE","source_asin":"B0B38QG4CN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38QG4CN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38QG4CN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
