window.products.push({"id":372899,"name":"ANTOBLE Pool Cleaner All Purpose Bag for Polaris 280, 480 Pool Cleaner Zippered All Purpose Bag K16 K13 - 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Aj+abeOJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Fit Polaris 280 or 480 Part No. Look at your existing bag. If it attaches to the column with a plastic clip with oval prongs, it is a 280 or 480. If it attaches to the column with a plastic clip with square prongs, it is a 360 or 380. How to Replace a Pool Cleaner Bag: Step 1: Turn off your booster pump and disconnect hose from the dedicated pressure cleaner line,then remove your cleaner from the pool. Step 2: Find the all purpose zipper bags on the top of cleaner,the bag's plastic cuff is the fastening element that keeps the bag attached to the cleaner during operation. Step 3: To release the pool sweep bag,turn the bag's plastic cuff either clockwise or counter a fraction of an inch to release the pressure paddles inside the cleaner body and lift up. Step 4: Discard worn or damaged zipper filter bag. Step 5: With your new pool filter Bag in hand, align the pressure paddles on the bag cuff and the arrow on the cleaner connector pipe and slide down until your hear it snap into place. Package Included: 2 x all purpose bag‎ for Polaris Notes: This is the non-original aftermarket parts This is the non-original aftermarket parts These vacuum cleaner replacement bags fit tight,please slightly twist as you're depressing the buttons. These vacuum cleaner replacement bags fit tight,please slightly twist as you're depressing the buttons. Please make sure to tuck the ends of the zipper fully under before completely zippering closed. Please make sure to tuck the ends of the zipper fully under before completely zippering closed. When you first put it in the water you need to squeeze all the air out of the replacement bag. When you first put it in the water you need to squeeze all the air out of the replacement bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Aj+abeOJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANTOBLE","source_asin":"B07ZFBQ7C7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZFBQ7C7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZFBQ7C7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
