window.products.push({"id":372907,"name":"California Map Matted Framed Art by Michael Tompsett in Black Frame, 16 by 20-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h3JpLTk6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This matted framed art piece features a colorful map of the state of California. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. 11x14 Size is an 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in a 11x14 black frame. 16x20 Size is an 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h3JpLTk6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00EQYRU9A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EQYRU9A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EQYRU9A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":372908,"name":"Asminifor Throw Pillow Covers Succulent Cactus Pillow Covers Flower Plants Leaves Throw Pillow Cases Cushion Covers for Home Sofa Couch Pillowcase 18 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510w8fZn8yL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Asminifor Aims Luxury and High Quality Home Decor Products to Your Daily Life. Features: Super Soft Fleece Fabric With a Brief Design and Look. This fabric is Durable and Easy to Handle, Soft and Pleasant to touch Size: 18\" x 18\"/pillow case WORKMANSHIP: Exquisite Hidden Zipper Closure was Designed for an Elegant Look, HIdden Zipper Design Can be Opened to Around 34-36 CM for Easy Insertion of Cushion. about 1.45 inch seam are done on the two margins to make sure that the pillow will be naturally full all way round after the insert of the core. Pls Kindly Note: 1. We offer PILLOW CASE ONLY, the CORE/INSERT EXCLUDED!!!2. For Manual Measurement's Sake, Please Accept A 1-2cm More or Less Allowance.3.Printed on ONE SIDE ONLY, And THE OTHER SIDE IS PLAIN--NO PRINTING.4.The printed pillow case my not be identical with the picture online, due to different exposure rate between monitors and naked eyes. Tips to Stuff Your Insert. Step 1. Get the core ready, open the pillow case on the zipper side, fold the core and put it inside the pillow case to the bottom.Step 2. Let go of your hand, make sure that your core has stuffed the corners of the pillow case, then close the zipper slowly to make sure it doest not split.Step 3. Slightly flap on your pillow to make sure the core will sit well. Package Content: 1 x Throw Pillow Covers These throw pillow covers are designed for simple style home decor, Asminifor cushion covers is available for different colors so you can match whichever color tone you like will go best with your decors in Living room, Bedroom, Office and Car. Welcome to our store, If you have any question, pls feel free let is know, Thank u and Wish You Have A Happy Shopping Time !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510w8fZn8yL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asminifor","source_asin":"B07M6YM4BQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M6YM4BQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M6YM4BQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
