window.products.push({"id":372918,"name":"Cheap Bedding Bed Sheet Set - 4 Piece Queen - Microfiber - White and Purple Deep Pockets -King Sheets Sets Closeout - 3 PC Twin Black and Yellow - Sab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nUNa5r3DS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Supreme blend of craftsmanship, our linens are designed to offer a unique and sophisticated sleeping experience. Twin SIZE This set includes a 3 PC sheet package consisting of a Flat Sheet (96\"x 66\") Fitted Sheet (75\"x 39\") 1 Pillow Case (20\"x 30\") Extra deep pockets fit around 12 inch deep mattresses. Soft and Breathable Fabric Bring a soft and cozy feel to your bed with our brushed microfiber sheet set. Our classic sheet set is designed with your comfort in mind. It is made of the finest brushed microfiber yarn to create a new standard in softness and breathability, making it hard to get out of bed in the morning. Also, these sheets have a plush texture and could be cleaned quickly and conveniently through a machine wash. Shrinkage & Fade Resistant Our sheet set is skillfully manufactured using strong and durable fabric that maintains the overall brightness and shape of the sheet for years. The microfiber material is processed to make it resistant to shrinkage after wash, and fading, which adds to the longevity of the set by keeping it in great condition. Give a smooth, finished look to your bed and experience a blissful night's sleep with this sheet set in possession. Care Instructions Ordinary washers and dryers can be used for easy care. Hand or machine wash in cold water with mild detergent is recommended. Washing at a high temperature causes microfiber to expand, releasing trapped dirt and micro-particles. If you consider hand washing, use a soft, bristled brush if necessary and rinse thoroughly. Air dry is best for drying as microfiber dries relatively quickly. However, if you plan to use the dryer, set it on low heat or no heat. This setting uses less quantity of water for laundering, less percentage of chemicals and consumes less energy for drying. Besides this, it is preshrunk to avoid any shrinkage after washing. Do not use fabric softeners as they clog up the open spaces in microfiber, which makes the fabric useless. Also, do not wash mi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nUNa5r3DS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedding","source_asin":"B083HLZLBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083HLZLBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083HLZLBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
