window.products.push({"id":372935,"name":"HIDBEA One Way Window Film, Daytime Privacy Sun Blocking Reflective Window Film No Glue Static Cling Heat Control Window Tinting Film for Home and Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V9tQsfXtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"HIDBEA window film creates a private and comfortable space for you. Note Paste the type from the indoor. Please do not use it for the rear view mirror of your car. Please do not use it as a mirror although it has a mirror effect. At night when the lighting is brighter inside than outside and you can see in, remember to draw the curtains. Applicable glass type Suitable for all smooth surface (non-bumpy) glass. Not suitable for rough surface and porous surface glass such as wood, tile or glass. Even for the structure of laminated glass and mesh glass, the surface is flat (smooth) and can be used safely. However, in areas exposed to direct sunlight for a long period of time (such as the Equatorial region), glass with steel wire or mesh, and Double Glazing and other films with a high heat absorption rate, heat cracking may occur. Please understand. Product Description 1. This window film is made of imported materials from Europe and America, healthy PET material, thicker than ordinary PVC material, more durable. 2. UV blocking window film can block UV rays, protect your skin from UV damage, reduce discoloration and aging caused by sunburn on furniture and flooring. 3. Heat control window film makes the room cooler, warmer in winter, and energy efficient. When the sun is strong (summer), it can greatly reduce the sunlight entering from the window, and use the UV barrier film to block the UV rays. In colder periods (winter), it acts as a heat insulator, reflecting infrared rays from the heater on the inside of the room and playing a \"secondary role\". The insulation film can reflect about 20%~30% of the heat source, making the room warmer and more comfortable. 4. Mirror window film has a unique mirror effect. At daytime, it looks like a mirror from the outside because of the brightness of the outside, and it protects the privacy by seeing the outside from inside. At night, when the interior is bright, you can see the interior from the outside, so you need to draw the curtains indoors at this time. 5. Window glass insulation film is anti-flyaway and has waterproof function. As long as the window film is applied to the window, the window glass will not fly apart even if it breaks. There is no need to worry about damage to important items by flying glass fragments. 6. As a decorative window film, it is fashionable both indoors and outdoors and has a decorative function. During the day, it reflects the clouds and the surrounding scenery like a mirror when viewed from outside. 7. This window film is easy to apply and is very versatile. It is suitable for use in hotels, government institutions, museums, banks, schools, commercial buildings, hospitals, foyers, flats, houses, etc. It can also be used in high rise buildings as it is installed from inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V9tQsfXtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIDBEA","source_asin":"B0C4FVZZ7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-372935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4FVZZ7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4FVZZ7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
